abstract: "A local web page and image builder for annotators who judge satellite fire alerts from before and after Sentinel-2 images, used for the human label check in 'Not Observed Is Not Calm: Where Open Sensors Go Blind and How to Verify Alerts for C2' (ICMCIS 2027 submission)."
